{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["workspace:read","email:read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Count eligible campaign recipients for an audience. The count reflects current consent and suppression records. Audiences: {\"kind\":\"all\"} for every subscriber; {\"kind\":\"tag\",\"tag\":KEY} for one tag; {\"kind\":\"segment\",\"match\":\"any\"|\"all\",\"tags\":[KEY...],\"exclude\":[KEY...]} to combine tags (anyone with any, or all, of tags, minus anyone with an exclude tag); {\"kind\":\"saved_segment\",\"id\":ID} for a segment from list_email_segments; {\"kind\":\"unopened\",\"runId\":ID} for people a sent campaign reached who haven't opened it. Tag keys are the key values from list_contact_tag_options. limit is the most one campaign can reach for this business now.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"audience":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"all","type":"string"}},"required":["kind"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"tag","type":"string"},"tag":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["kind","tag"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"exclude":{"items":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"type":"array"},"kind":{"const":"segment","type":"string"},"match":{"enum":["any","all"],"type":"string"},"tags":{"items":{"maxLength":60,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":20,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["kind","match","tags","exclude"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"unopened","type":"string"},"runId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff